# "If you cast it": Yathan put onto the battlefield from the graveyard with Reanimate (Entomb put it there) was not cast,
# so its trigger never happens (CR 603.4): nothing is milled and nothing returned, with Hired Blade sitting in the
# library as the card that would have been milled. Bot1 pays 4 life for Reanimate (Yathan's mana value). The positive
# control, cast, is yathan-roadwatcher-mills-four-then-returns-a-three-drop-of-yours-only.

